4进5，以后飞3象有利于1路车的出动。","text":"这样走较亏！弈天的高手都走士4进5，以后飞3象有利于1路车的出动。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"进马不如象7进5补厚中路。","text":"进马不如象7进5补厚中路。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"现在红方多中兵且双车灵活，优势明显。","text":"现在红方多中兵且双车灵活，优势明显。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment31","raw_text":"也可改走车二平三。","text":"也可改走车二平三。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"0:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"眼见红方要兵换双象破城，黑竟然束手无策。","text":"眼见红方要兵换双象破城，黑竟然束手无策。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"黑方又抵挡几着认输。如改走马7退6，马五退四，车6进4，炮三平五，也是红方胜势。","text":"黑方又抵挡几着认输。如改走马7退6，马五退四，车6进4，炮三平五，也是红方胜势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment45:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment45","raw_text":"红胜||黑方大概看到城池破碎还要丢车，遂认输。末尾红方的攻法对一般爱好者也非难事，更何况他们。","text":"红胜\n黑方大概看到城池破碎还要丢车，遂认输。末尾红方的攻法对一般爱好者也非难事，更何况他们。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":45,"anchor_node_id":"0:45","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["周德裕 先胜 张锦荣"],"DhtmlXQ_event":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["周德裕"],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["张锦荣"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"